# Cursor Rules for Karwa Project

## Location Data
- Always refer to `karwa-FE/src/data/kuwait_regions.ts` for any location-based logic related to Kuwait governorates and areas.
- The file contains structured data for all 6 Kuwait governorates with their respective areas.
- When working with location selection, address forms, or location-related features, use the data from `kuwait_regions.ts` as the source of truth.
- Import using: `import kuwaitRegionsData from "@/src/data/kuwait_regions"`

## Project Structure
- Frontend: `karwa-FE/` - React Native/Expo app
- Backend: `karwa-BE/` - Node.js/Express API
- Location data: `kuwait_regions.json` - Kuwait governorates and areas database

